Ledgerly (账序)

Ledgerly is an independent accounting application developed from the concepts
and local extensions of EasyAccounts. It does not require an EasyAccounts
server, database, frontend build or AI service to run.

EasyAccounts upstream: https://github.com/QingHeYang/EasyAccounts
Development starting point: https://github.com/goldenfishs/EasyAccounts
